    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Class A Ordinary Shares&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left">class A ordinary
shares of par value US$0.0<FONT STYLE="text-decoration: underline double; color: blue">00000</FONT>1 each of the Company having the rights
set out in these Articles.</P></TD></TR>
