<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 2in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Conversion Date&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">in respect of a Conversion Notice means the day on which that Conversion Notice is delivered.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Conversion Notice&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">a written notice delivered to the Company at its Office (and as otherwise stated therein) stating that a holder of Class B Ordinary Shares elects to convert the number of Class B Ordinary Shares specified therein pursuant to Article 9.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Conversion Number&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">in relation to any Class B Ordinary Shares, such number of Class A Ordinary Shares as may, upon exercise of the Conversion Right, be issued at the Conversion Rate.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Conversion Rate&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">means, at any time, on a 1 : 1 basis.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Conversion Right&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">in respect of a Class B Ordinary Share means the right of its holder, subject to the provisions of these Articles and to any applicable fiscal or other laws or regulations including the Law, to convert all or any of its Class B Ordinary Shares, into the Conversion Number of Class A Ordinary Shares in its discretion.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 0.125in; text-indent: -0.125in; text-align: left">&ldquo;debenture&rdquo;&nbsp;and&nbsp;<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;debenture holder&rdquo;</FONT>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">include debenture stock and debenture stockholder <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">respectively.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>

<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Designated Stock Exchange&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">means The NASDSAQ for so long as the Company&rsquo;s Shares or ADSs are there listed and any other stock exchange on which the Company&rsquo;s Shares or ADSs are listed for trading.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;dollars&rdquo; and &ldquo;$&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">dollars, the legal currency of the United States of America.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Exchange Act&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;head office&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">such office of the Company as the Directors may from time to time determine to be the principal office of the Company.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Law&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The Companies Act Cap. 22 (Law 3 of 1961, as consolidated and revised) of the Cayman Islands.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;Member&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">a duly registered holder from time to time of the shares in the capital of the Company.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;month&rdquo;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">a calendar month.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
